  "label": "Sea Monkeys (brand/product)",
  "description": "Sea Monkeys are a brand of brine shrimp (Artemia) that are sold as a novelty pet. They are marketed as 'aquatic pets' that hatch from a packet and are often associated with childhood nostalgia and kitschy science experiments. The term is not a real animal but a commercial product, and its use here is absurd and humorous, contrasting with the real children playing in water.",
